{"2652120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "驱邪师", "steam_appid": 2652120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4957180], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Exorcist&quot;</strong> is a first-person horror role-playing game. The story takes place in a haunted house, where players must explore the house, gather clues, and eventually piece together the truth behind the haunting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Story Background</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play as an exorcist hired to investigate a haunted house. The owner's wife recently committed suicide. However, since her body was cremated, strange events have been occurring one after another… As an exorcist, you must delve deep into this haunted house shrouded in resentment, uncover the truth behind the owner's wife's suicide, and complete the exorcism ritual before the female ghost completely consumes him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Gameplay</strong></i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person perspective</strong> immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/fdf3dcc5cca9d605d86e97f5d5283b98.poster.avif?t=1786190221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/fdf3dcc5cca9d605d86e97f5d5283b98.webm?t=1786190221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/fdf3dcc5cca9d605d86e97f5d5283b98.mp4?t=1786190221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> – Survey the environment and gather clues to gradually piece together the truth behind the house's haunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/b45746d657a23d8ac0751405f14753ee.poster.avif?t=1786190221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/b45746d657a23d8ac0751405f14753ee.webm?t=1786190221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/b45746d657a23d8ac0751405f14753ee.mp4?t=1786190221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape &amp; Hide</strong> – Stay aware of your surroundings and flee immediately when needed. The ghost will actively attack the player, who must survive by hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/e9b29563ea108ef73f373fce65d15743.poster.avif?t=1786190221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/e9b29563ea108ef73f373fce65d15743.webm?t=1786190221\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/e9b29563ea108ef73f373fce65d15743.mp4?t=1786190221\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/5adccac47e2ed6b34a16f62cae2c59fe.poster.avif?t=1786190221\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652120/extras/5adccac47e2ed6b34a16f62cae2c59fe